    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47480" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠπί̆ᾰλ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ague</i>, <i><span class="en">
